@WebApi_HostAddress = https://localhost:7102
@AccessToken = REPLACE_WITH_JWT_ACCESS_TOKEN

### Регистрация юриста
POST {{WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/authentication/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "lawyer@example.com",
  "password": "Replace-With-Strong-Password-1!",
  "fullName": "Тестовый юрист",
  "lawFirmName": null,
  "phoneNumber": null
}

### Вход
POST {{WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/authentication/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "lawyer@example.com",
  "password": "Replace-With-Strong-Password-1!"
}

### Текущий профиль
GET {{WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/authentication/me
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Текущая ИИ-квота
GET {{WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/artificialintelligence/usage
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}
Accept: application/json
